= Bourgeois coalition collapses...

Following irreconcilable differences between the Catholic Zentrum and the secular DVP over the "School Law," not even meetings between Marx and Stresemann could prevent the coalition's inevitable collapse. Consequently, Zentrum's Wilhelm Marx resigned, leaving the cabinet to serve in a caretaker capacity to pass the budget until June, when Hindenburg would dissolve it completely.

With the recent trend of special interest parties and parties of the left gaining upperhand, it seems like another right wing cabinet is, impossible.